        "created_at": "2025-11-17T06:02:40.857Z",
        "cooked": "<p>For question 5 the mark is shown as zero.Does it mean that the question will not be considerd for evaluation.For question 8  the option 1 is not correct as using mkdir you can create a directory with .txt as extention .If you execute the script this file will not be shown as, the command only prints the regular files.This was pointed out last sem also by one student.Please make necessary correction while evaluating.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/flex013/uploads/iitm/original/3X/3/0/302be6787b147c7e941486baa5f970340cb6ffe2.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/6S8YpVYXIEu8Olm2ywwDNhxiDh8.png?dl=1\" title=\"image\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><img src=\"https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/flex013/uploads/iitm/optimized/3X/3/0/302be6787b147c7e941486baa5f970340cb6ffe2_2_225x500.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"6S8YpVYXIEu8Olm2ywwDNhxiDh8\" width=\"225\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/flex013/uploads/iitm/optimized/3X/3/0/302be6787b147c7e941486baa5f970340cb6ffe2_2_225x500.png, https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/flex013/uploads/iitm/optimized/3X/3/0/302be6787b147c7e941486baa5f970340cb6ffe2_2_337x750.png 1.5x, https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/flex013/uploads/iitm/optimized/3X/3/0/302be6787b147c7e941486baa5f970340cb6ffe2_2_450x1000.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F2F3F3\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1080×2400 267 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
